'''Tinkatink''' (Japanese: '''カヌチャン''' ''Kanuchan'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

